                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "All decimal and hexadecimal character references are supported (e.g., "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "&#169;"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "). However, the converter only processes a restricted set of named entities. The recognized named entities are as follows: amp, apos, gt, lt, nbsp, and quot (e.g., "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "&apos;"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": ")."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Copying text from a PDF in a way that preserves the original line wrapping is not reliable, particularly in code blocks. To achieve proper rendering, non-visible characters may either be interpreted, inserted, or dropped. This is primarily a limitation of the PDF format, in which text is broken into fragments and positioned at absolute coordinates on the canvas."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Footnotes are always displayed as endnotes (at the bottom of the last page of a chapter for books; at the bottom of the last page of the document for all other doctypes). "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Footnotes cannot be displayed at the current bottom of the page because the PDF generator does not support content reflows"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "strong",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " (see "
                  },
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "#85"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "link",
                    "metadata": {
                      "rel": "noopener",
                      "window": "_blank"
                    },
                    "target": "https://github.com/asciidoctor/asciidoctor-pdf/issues/85#issuecomment-577412975"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " for reasoning)."
                  }
